---
description: Rails conventions
globs: ["app/**/*.rb", "lib/**/*.rb", "config/**/*.rb", "db/migrate/**/*.rb"]
---
- RESTful controllers, 7 standard actions; thin controllers; authorize every action.
- Strong params via params.expect; no SQL interpolation; includes/preload to avoid N+1.
- Validations + DB constraints. Reversible, zero-downtime-safe migrations with indexes.
- Side effects in jobs (idempotent, pass IDs). No html_safe/raw on user input.
- Run `bundle exec rspec <file>` and `bin/rubocop <file>` after edits.
